  <spoon:CtClass name="BoilerConstants">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="Constants of the boiler (SB-DM1), of the steam exit (SB-DM2), of the pumps (SB-DM3) and of the&#xA;control cycle (SB-V3, SB-V10).&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The requirements name the boiler, steam and pump constants without giving their values. The&#xA;values below are chosen to satisfy the relations the requirements state: M1 &amp;lt; N1 &amp;lt; N2 &amp;lt;&#xA;M2 &amp;lt; C; M1 is at least the steam that can escape in five seconds at the maximal rate W; and&#xA;C - M2 is at least the water all four pumps can supply in five seconds."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
    <modifier>FINAL</modifier>
